I found a mislaid character just lying around in a closet somewhere -- a
level 9 Valky with Mjollnir and AC -7 (which is pretty decent, IMHO).
So I was having fun wasting gnomes and dwarves on level 12 of the mines,
gleefully chanting "I'm gonna wipe your ass" at every G or h which dared
appear on the screen.
When suddenly . . 
I step on a polymorph trap and turn into a killer bee.  As all my stuff
is dropping around me, all of a sudden the game bags out on me and I'm
left with the message: floating exception.  (i think that was it.)
Poof -- character gone, not to be found in the save file.  I have never
heard of this error before, much less encountered it myself.  Sigh . . .
I guess that means you shouldn't polymorph into a bee while carrying
Mjollnir.
